<Grid
  xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
  xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">
<Grid.RowDefinitions>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="10"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="10"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="10"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
    </Grid.RowDefinitions>
    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
        <ColumnDefinition Width="10"/>
        <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
	<!--TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" HorizontalAlignment="Left" Text="1985-8-18" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}"/-->
	<TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" HorizontalAlignment="Left" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}">
		IMMEDIATE
		<LineBreak/>
		O 06 0600Z MAR 88
	</TextBlock>
    <!--TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" HorizontalAlignment="Right" Text="05:00Z (06:00L)" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}"/-->

    <TextBlock Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="FM"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="RED BANNER PACIFIC FLEET"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="TO"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="CO {TaskForceName}"/>
	<TextBlock Grid.Row="5" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="INFO"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="5" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}">
		10th OPERATIONAL SQN
		<LineBreak/>
		11th OPERATIONAL SQN
	</TextBlock>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="7" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="SUBJ"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="7" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="OPERATION ORDER"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="9" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" TextWrapping="Wrap">
		SECRET
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		1. (S) {TaskForceName} must escort SF Narod to the Exit Area. The enemy knows we are coming, no need for EMCON.
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		2. (S) Unknown submarine threat in area; US SSNs remain elusive. Also, several Japanese SSKs have ignored surrender order and have not returned to base. 
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		3. (S) Enemy air threat medium, expect Japanese airstrkes from Okinawa. High probability USAF assets in Guam will attempt intediction with escorted B-52 raids. 
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		4. (S) Enemy surface threat medium, Naha possesses a small garrison consisting of 2+ DDG. 
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		5. (S) Former Japanese airfield in Nyutabaru available for friendly aircraft. 
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		6. (S) {TaskForceName} is to resupply in Sasebo post-mission. Elements of SF Narod will join your force when this mission ends. Good Luck, Comrade.
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		SIGNED: Khvatov
		<LineBreak/>
		KTOF
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		SECRET
		<LineBreak/>
		DECL OADR BT
	  </TextBlock>
</Grid>